6469).\n- **Evidence:** new regression test `snapshot_and_tail_payloads_must_not_carry_over_version_entries` (over-version snapshot and tail refused with tracker state untouched, signer refusal, version-10 control snapshot accepted); replication module 62/62 pass; full id-worlds suite 734/734 pass; cargo fmt clean.\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=repo-worker-code state=done at=2026-11-17T04:46:00Z -->\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/comments/6937570239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/comments/6944851486","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/7970#issuecomment-6944851486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7970","id":6944851486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJWP4788AAAABnfIGHg","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-17T10:03:12Z","updated_at":"2026